// Package builtin implements the agent's built-in file tools (read_file, list_files, search_files) and Workspace,
// the one place that decides whether a file tool may touch a path.
//
// A file tool takes the *Workspace and goes through its resolve/check/openRoot; it never opens a model-supplied path
// directly. Confinement to the work directory, the deny list and the trace directory are enforced there.
